    <string name="option_auto_retry">Retry automatically</string>
    <string name="option_auto_retry_description">Try the failed tracks again by itself, whatever went wrong: after 15, 30 and 60 minutes (3 attempts at most). Unavailable tracks are not retried. Works while the app or the server keeps running.</string>
    <string name="option_debug_log">Debug log</string>
    <string name="option_debug_log_description">Record in detail how each link was resolved, how titles were parsed into artists and file names, and every lyrics search with the reason a result was rejected. Secrets are masked. Share it from the job to attach it to an issue.</string>

